✅ Step 2: Run the Backend

📂 In the backend project folder, run:

mvn clean spring-boot:run
▶️ Recommended Run Order

✅ Start Backend first

✅ Then start Frontend

✅ Run Gaia tests only after both are healthy

✅ Quick Health Check (Simple)

🟢 Backend is running with no errors in terminal

🟢 Frontend opens successfully and loads pages

🧪 Only then execute the Gaia test suite
